# IO_Stress (PowerCycle)

This directory drives reboot/dc power-cycle FIO on the DUT.

## Entry points
- `powercycle_direct.sh` — first loop from pytest (`-i reboot|dc`)
- `run_fio.sh` — resume after reboot (`REBOOT`/`DC`) and Jenkins `RESTORE`
- `Fio_All.sh -i restore` — cleanup/restore helper

## FIO models
Models are generated each loop by `powercycle_random.py` into `powercycle_auto.csv` (FILL → STRESS → VERIFY). No static `Input_Config_*.csv` is used.

## Modes
- REBOOT / DC: power cycle with bare-disk FIO (`disk_mode=ALL`, `mix_io=NO`)
- RESTORE: cleanup only
